<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">1 Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Te</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh ɓi Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh ɓi Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kaɗaŋ Pool koc ŋ kur kaŋ Tessalonik,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">Tum ci 17:1-9</ref></char></note> wa nikee ŋ ɗooƴ ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka kanakɗoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:40-18:22">Tum ci 15:40–18:22</ref></char></note> A yegɗohha <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> nga, te wa raakka ɓi kos, waaye a arra aañu ne a pul kur ka. Wa jaahiɗta ɗe lool, findi ɓooɓa han kos na hee moocohe. Weɗ tah, wa a nik ŋ Ateen,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15-18:1">Tum ci 17:15–18:1</ref></char></note> a woossa Timoote ne a kaɗ marka findi ɓa nikoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:1-2">1 Tessalonik 3:1-2</ref></char></note> Ƴutta, a yi Pool, a taalndiɗta Korenta. Timoote hunnda na Silweng a kaɗta marka ɓi Tessalonik, te a wiirukka na yegɗoh neɓiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:6">1 Tessalonik 3:6</ref></char></note> Ɓa raakka Pool ŋ Korenta.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Tum ci 18:5</ref></char></note> Weɗ Pool fiisoh ɓi Tessalonik kaɓɗohii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ fiisi a kaɓɗoh wii, Pool corkiɗiɗ Kooh nga, a teeɓohha sumi a sum ŋ risi ɓi Tessalonik ris pes ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>, na maɗi a maɗ ɓa hotis. A nammba ɓa ñaah na ɓi woo, a teeɓohha in ci kaɗ ŋ wiirkiŋ Kiristaani. Wa degga ɓi caɓin, a fiisissa ɓa kaɓɗoh, wa nikka 2 Tessalonik.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool koc kaɓɗoh ɓi Tessalonik kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool kañɗiɗ ɓi Tessalonik, a kiimiɗta ɓa Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:1-10">1:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool naandsukiɗ jamanoona a nikoh ŋ Tessalonik <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 2:1-16">2:1-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool mariɗ hot ɓi Tessalonik, a rahsiɗ kerahne neɓiɗ nga ɓa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 2:17-3:11">2:17–3:11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kiim Kooh wuu ɓi Tessalonik <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 3:12-13">3:12-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pes findi Kooh waaɗoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ini kaɗ ŋ wiirkiŋ Kiristaani <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4:13–5:11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh ci mirndoh na askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-28">5:12-28</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Mi yii kañiɗ ɗu, ɗu ɓi Janguuniŋ Tessalonik. Mi, Pool, na Silweng na Timoote, ɓoo ɓii kañiɗ ɗu, ɗu ɓi nik ŋ Kooh Baabi na Yeesu <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaa</char> Heɗi. Baahohsaat, ɗu onu jam !<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kipes ki na kosiŋ ɓi Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Ɓoo na gene corkiɗ Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗu jen ne ɓoo ɓaahndohha ɗu ŋ kiim ciŋ ɓoo ɗah. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓoo na gene naandsuk ŋ fiki Kooh Baabi tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu sagu kosi ɗu kos Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa, na pangkiŋ ɗu miskiɗi sagu waaɗi ɗu waaɗ ɗe na mini ɗu min muñ sagu oolki ɗu ooluk in ci a gapoh. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo, Kooh waaɗiɗ ɗu te ɓoo inhiɗ ne, a taniɗ ɗu, a tummba ɗu wuu ce. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Ɓoo inhiɗa, laam, wa ɓoo kom ɗu Yegɗohiŋ Muci, wa nikeeɗi woo dong, waaye wa namee hun na ɓaatɗohi na hatiliŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, te ineem wooreen ɓoo keeh-keeh. Te ɗu inhiɗ findi ɓoo mandee ŋ harmban ɗu, wa nikee ini baah nga ɗu.<verse eid="1TH 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Ini kaɗ nga ɗu, ɗu taambɗiɗ kot ciŋ ɓoo na ciŋ Heɗi, ŋ teyɗuki ɗu teyɗuk woo kiŋ Kooh ŋ ɗooƴ miskiɗ laayiɗ ; Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani sumɗukohha ɗu. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Ini ɗu tum weem, kosiɗ ciŋ Maseduwaan na Akaay jen miniɗ marak nga ɗu, ɓa taambiɗ ɗu. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Laam woo kiŋ Heɗi puloh nga ɗu kaɗta kur caŋ Maseduwaan na caŋ Akaay jen, waaye wa topɗi ndeem, kosiŋ ɗu Kooh reyiɗ ɗisik nu ɗisik. Wa kaɗiɗ po wa etohɗi sah ɓoo woyee ŋ ini kaɗ nga, <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>laam ɓooɓi jen ɓa ɗii laamtoh findi ɗu taambɗukoh ɓoo wi ɓoo hay nga ɗu, na findi ɗu faɗoh kooh ci nikaaɗiici, ɗu hayya ŋ Kooh, ne ɗu ñaamuk ɗe. A yi Koohi na pese, yi keeh-keehi. <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>Ɓa ɗi nam woo findi ɗu na sekohe <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char> pulohan Eel ci, yi a hultiɗ, Yeesu yi na mucɗe ɓoo ŋ ayruki na haye.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">In ci Pool haɓiɗ ŋ Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo, ɗu ŋ haf ɗu, ɗu inhiɗ ne hayi ɓoo hayee nga ɗu nikeeɗi ɓarang ɓarang. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Ɗu namiɗ inah ne bala ineem, ɓoo torhiɗuuɗ, ɓasuusa ngaŋ kur-taahaŋ Filippi. Waaye Kooh tufkohiɗ ɓoo po ɓoo minnda ɗu woo <char style="w" lemma="Yegɗohiŋ Muci">Yegɗohiŋ ɗe ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Muci</char>, ngaŋ hiñoh miskiɗ. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓeeɗkohi ɓoo na ɓeeɗke ɓooɓi jen degukɗi ŋ ini raakɗi wala ŋ liiɓohaaɗ moɗaaɗi, te ɓoo waakɗi ñaañoh ali ɓo' nga. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Kooh hotiɗ ne ɓoo cariɗ oolku, a dengkohha ɓoo Yegɗohiŋ Muci, weɗ tah ɓoo waakɗi ini neɓ ɓooɓi, waaye ini neɓ Kooh yi na markiske keeñ ciŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="1TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Ɗu inhiɗa baahiɗ, ɓoo moosɗi jayoh ɓo' ne raak in nga ɗe ; te ɓoo moosɗi leyoh ɓo' sagu waaɗ raak, Kooh seede'iɗ ineem. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Ɓoo waakɗi ne ɓo' ɗaap ɓoo, wa nga ɗu haa, wa ŋ ɓinooɓi haa ; <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>te kat, ɓoo mineen ɗu teeɓ ne ɓoo kilifaaciŋ ɗu ŋ niki ɓoo nik <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>. Waaye ɓoo tumɗaa, ɓoo soos soos nga ɗu findi yaayi ɓop kuɓuuciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Waaɗi ɓoo waaɗ ɗu topeeɗi ŋ woo ɗu Yegɗohiŋ Muci dong, waaye, ɓoo teyɗukeen ɓaah na ɗu kipes kiŋ ɓoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"ɓoo teyɗukeen ɓaah na ɗu kipes kiŋ ɓoo" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min tokis : "ɓoo teyɗukeen eɗoh kipes kiŋ ɓoo wuu ɗu".</char></note>. Ɓoo keeñkoheen ɗu lool !<verse eid="1TH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo, ɗu naandsukiɗ panguk ciŋ ɓoo miskiɗ ci na yaaɓi ɓoo yaaɓ. Ɓoo pangkee noh na wek ne ɓoo deguu ali ɓo' nga ɗu in, ɓoo woo ɗu Yegɗohiŋ Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Muci. <verse eid="1TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Ɗu seedeeciŋ ɓoo, Kooh namiɗa nik : Ɗu ɓi kosiɗ ci, findi ɓoo mandee nga ɗu, wa hooliɗ, wa yurhiɗ te wa raakɗi sikka. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Ɗu namiɗ inah ne ɓoo tumohee na yaa nu nga ɗu findi baabu na tumohe na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Ɓoo ñaahiɗ ɗu, ɓoo giifɗiɗ ɗu, ɓoo woyiɗ na ɗu keeh-keeh ne ɗu pes findi ɓoyi nik na Kooh na pesohe, Kooh yi ɓeeɗuk ɗu ne ɗu ɓaah ŋ yaki Nguuriŋ ɗe yak.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Ɓoo gen ŋ corkiɗ Kooh sagu inii : Wa ɗu rahas woo kiŋ Kooh ɓoo woo ɗu, ɗu teyɗukɗi wa findi woo ɓo', waaye ɗu teyɗuka findi woo kiŋ Kooh, te weɗ wa nik keeh-keeh. Ŋ ineem, weɗi ɓay ɓoƴsoh nga ɗu, ɗu ɓi kosiɗ ci.<verse eid="1TH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo, ɗu taamb ŋ ɗiski Janguuciŋ Yudee taamb, Janguuci ɓaah ŋ Kooh te ca kossa Kiristaani Yeesu. Laam, ɓi gen na ɗu namiɗ ɗu torhiɗ torhiɗ miskiɗ, findi Yawuut ci torhiɗohee Janguucaam. <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>Ɓeɗ ap Yeesu Heɗi, ɓeɗ namee ap woosuuɗ ci, te ɓeɗ tolfiɗee ɓoo. Ɓa neɓɗi Kooh te ɓa sangiɗ ciŋ ɓooɓiŋ Adina jen. <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Ɓa sangiɗ ciŋ ɓooɓi ŋ ini ɓa na jeeme hondoh ɓoo woo Yegɗohiŋ Muci ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut ne ɓa mucɗu. Ŋ ineem, ɓa na mitɗe bakaaɗ ci ɓa tum ŋ jamanooci jen. Waaye ayrukiŋ Kooh mirndohiɗ keen ŋ ɗafuk ɓa.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool waaɗiɗ hotis ɓi Tessalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Ini kaɗ nga ɓoo, ɓaah ci, ɓoo saɓsohuuɗ na ɗu ɓi jamano ɓoo hotohisɗi, waaye ɗu ɓii ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo. Ɓoo waaɗiɗ ɗu hotis lool te ɓoo tumiɗ in nu in ne wa nik. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Ɓoo waaɗeen hayis ɗiskiŋ ɗu, te mi ŋ haf fo, ŋ jeemiɗ ɗu hay marke waas laayiɗ. Waaye Seytaani hondohha ɓoo tuma. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Mbehi Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu hayissan, ya ɓa nikan yaakaariŋ ɓoo, wala sumiŋ ɓoo, wala raayaaniŋ ɓoo po ɓoo min neɓu ŋ fikiice ? Ali wa mand na, ɗu ɓaah nga ! <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Ee, e ɗu ndamiŋ ɓoo na sumiŋ ɓoo !<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1-2"/>Wa kaɗ kaɗ po ŋ mirndaani, ɓoo minisɗi sek. Weɗ ɓoo woyoh ne ɓoo hey faɗe Timoote a kaɗ, ɓoo tas ŋ Ateen kiik ɓoo. Ɓoo woossa ɗe nga ɗu. Timoote a ɓaah ɓoo keeh-keeh ; a na pangke na Kooh ŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>. Ɓoo nakiɗ ɗe ne a ndengiɗ ɗu, a ñaah ɗu ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kosiŋ ɗu, <verse eid="1TH 3:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>po ali ɓo' nga ɗu naarkuu, sagu miskiɗ ci ɗu na degse woti-woti. Ɗu ŋ haf ɗu, ɗu inhiɗ ne in ceem ɓaah ŋ in ci rahsan ɓoo ŋ kosi ɓoo kos. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Laam wa ɓoo nik na ɗu sah, ɓoo woyeen ɗu ne ɓoo hey raake miskiɗ ; te wa raakoh ɗaa, findi ɗu inhoha. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Wa wa kaɗ po ŋ minisɗi sek, ŋ woossa Timoote ne a markiɗ to ini kaɗ ŋ kosiŋ ɗu, laam ŋ neƴƴoheen ne Seytaani fiir ɗu po pangkiŋ ɓoo kee nika ɓarang ɓarang.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Waaye ɗiski wa nik, Timoote kaɗiɗ po a hayiɗ, te a eɗiɗ ɓoo yegɗoh neɓiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kosiŋ ɗu, na waaɗohi ɗu waaɗoh ŋ harmban ɗu, na sumi ɗu na sume ɗu naandsukka ɓoo ɗah, na waaɗi ɗu waaɗ ɓoo hotis findi ɓoo namoh ɗu waaɗ hotis. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Ŋ ineem, ŋ ɗooƴ tiis ci na miskiɗ ci ɓoo nikoh jen, hel ciŋ ɓoo daliɗ nga ɗu, ɓaah ci, sagu kosiŋ ɗu. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Kon ɗiski wa nik, ɗu ris ndengiɗ ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Heɗi, weɗ tah ɓoo ɓii iik kotii.<verse eid="1TH 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Ɓoo joyiɗ corkiɗ Kooh laayoh na laayoh ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗu, ŋ sumi ɓoo sum lool saguuɗu ŋ fikiice. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Noh na wek ɓoo ɓii kiim ɗe keeh-keeh ne a on ɓoo, ɓoo hotis ɗu te ɓoo mitiɗ ini tas ŋ kosiŋ ɗu. <verse eid="1TH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Kooh, Baabiŋ ɓoo ŋ haf ce, na Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu rangsiɗaat ɓoo waasi kaɗ nga ɗu ! <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Heɗi genaat ɓaat keeh-keeh waaɗohi nik ŋ harmban ɗu, na waaɗi ɗu waaɗ ɓooɓi jen, wa nikaat findi ɓoo waaɗoh ɗu. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>A on keeñ ciŋ ɗu hatil ne ɗu nik hooliɗ wuu ce, raakaaɗi sikka ŋ fiki Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo, ŋ mbehi Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu hayan, na hooliɗ ciŋ ɗe jen. [Amiin !]<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Pes findi Kooh waaɗoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Ɗiski wa nik, ɓaah ci, ɗu jangiɗ nga ɓoo findi ɗu joy pesoh ne ɗu neɓ Kooh, te ɗu ɓii tuma, waaye ɓoo ɓii kiim ɗu te ɓoo ɓii ñaah ɗu ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu Heɗi, ɓaataat ineem. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Ɗu inhiɗ nakoh ci ɓoo eɗ ɗu ŋ tiikiŋ Yeesu Heɗi. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh, weɗ ne ɗu hool wuu ce, ɗu wortuk faankoh sangohuuɗ, <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah ambaat cir ciŋ faaniŋ ɗe, wa hun na hool wuu Kooh na eɗoh cir. <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Wa hunuu na taambiɗ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ kiñin kiŋ ɗa, findi cuuɓ ci inahɗi Kooh na tumohee wa. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Ŋ inii, ali ɓo' nga ɗu kinaat ñaañoh morom ce wala a njirñiɗkohee ɗe. Inhaat ne Heɗi na atte'e atte in ceem, ɓoo woyiɗ ɗu wa, woyissa ɗu wa.<verse eid="1TH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Kooh ɓeeɗukɗi ɓoo ne ɓoo nik hoolaaɗi, waaye a ɓeeɗuk ɓoo ne ɓoo hool wuu ce. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Ŋ ineem, yi na hee sange teyɗuk woo ceem, a sang ɓo' haa, waaye a sang Kooh, yi eɗ ɗu <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ ɗe Hoolohngaani</char>.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ waaɗoh ŋ harmban ɗu, ɗu ɓi ɓaah kos, ɗu etohɗi fiisu ŋ ini kaɗ nga, Kooh jangɗiɗ ɗu waaɗtiɗoh ŋ harmban ɗu. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Ɗu na tiindɗohe ɗaa na ɓaah ci nik ŋ Maseduwaan jen. Waaye, ɓoo ɓii ñaah ɗu ɓaah ci, ɓaataat ineem. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Waakaat pes ŋ jam na ɓooɓi, yaa nu nga nik ngaŋ in ciŋ ɗe haf ce, ɗu pangkoote na yaah ciŋ ɗu, ɓoo nakohee ɗu wa ɗaa. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Ŋ ineem, ɗu etohanɗi ali ɓo', te ɓi kosɗi hey ɗu mine eɗ cir ŋ findi ɗu na pesohe.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaaniɗ ci na hayisiŋ Heɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Ɓaah ci, ɓoo waaɗɗi ne ɗu nik inhaaɗi ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓi kuruk nga, po ɗu kee raaka tiis findi ɓinooɓi, ɓi raakɗi yaakaar. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Ŋ ineem, findi ɓoo kosoha, Yeesu kaaniɗ te a hultiɗ, ɓi kaan te ɓa kossa ɗe, Kooh ɓayndohohan ɓa ɗaa taamboh ŋ Yeesu, ɓa hun na Yeesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Inii weɗ ɓoo na woyee ɗu te wa puloh ŋ Heɗi : Ɓoo ɓi risan pes po ŋ hayisiŋ Heɗi, ɓoo adganɗi ɓi kuruk nga. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Laam nakoh hey leehkasse, hooso kilifa malaaka kerhuk, kuluɓ kiŋ Kooh kerhuk, ŋ ineem, Heɗi ŋ haf ce hey pulohe ŋ Eel ci, ruhse, te kaaniɗ ci nik ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> hey koce kuruk. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Ƴut ɗah, ɓoo ɓi risan ndii pese, ɓoo hey ambsohse na ɓa, coottohse ŋ ɗooƴ eel, ɓoo kaɗ taambɗuka Heɗi, ngaŋ jawuuni. Ini kooɗoh ndeem, ɓoo nikan na ɗe po faw. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Kon, yaa nu nga ɗu giifɗaat morom ce na woo ceem.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Sek mbehiŋ Heɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Ɓaah ci, ini kaɗ ŋ jamanooni wala mbehi, wa etohɗi ɗu fiisu ŋ ini kaɗ nga ca. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Ɗu ŋ haf ɗu, ɗu inhiɗ baahiɗ ne mbehiŋ Heɗi hayan findi rokoh na wek.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:42-44">Macce 24:42-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luk 12:39-40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Ɓooɓi hey woye ne : « Ɓoo ɓii ŋ jam te ɗiski ɓoo nik, wa wooriɗ ! » Jaar naamo hay nga ɓa, tel ɓa findi miskiɗ ciŋ ɓitɓi na ɓasle, te ɓa fusanɗi nga muk.<verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Waaye ɗu, ɓaah ci, ɗu nikɗi ŋ ñuus, po mbeheem kee ɗu tela findi rokoh. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Ɗu jen, ɗu ɓo' siñaar, ɗu ɓo' noh. Ɓoo ɓaahɗi ŋ wek, ɓoo ɓaahɗi ŋ ñuus. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Ɓoo kinaat neeh findi ɓinooɓi, ɓoo yunkaat, ɓoo hun na sagoociŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Ɓi na neehe, na neehe na wek, te ɓi na laare na laare na wek.<verse eid="1TH 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Waaye ɓoo ɓi ɓaah ŋ nohi, ɓoo hunaat na sagoociŋ ɓoo ; ɓoo ɓekuk waaɗoh na kos findi kulɓa hiñohoha, te kong ci ɓoo ɓekuk nik oolki ɓoo ooluk ne ɓoo hey mucɗasse. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Ini Kooh waaɗiɗ ɓoo, wa ayrukiŋ ɗe haa, waaye a waaɗ ne ɓoo rahas muci taamboh ŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Yeesu, a yi kaan wuu ɓoo, ne a hay ɗah, ɓoo ɓaah na ɗe kipes ki, wa raak ɓoo pesee, wa raak ɓoo kaaniɗ, wa ɗaa. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Ineem weɗ tah, ñaahtiɗohaat, yaa nu nga amboh morom ce ne a kaɗ fiki, findi ɗu na tumohee wa an.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nakoh ci mirndoh na askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Ɓoo ɓii kiim ɗu ɓaah ci, ne ɗu eɗ cir ɓi na ndengɗuke ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu, ɓi adgoh ɗu ŋ Heɗi te ɓa woytohee ɗu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Eɗaat ɓa cir keeh-keeh, ɗu waaɗ ɓa sagu ini ɓa na haɓɗe, pesaat ŋ jam ŋ harmban ɗu. <verse eid="1TH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Ɓoo ɓii ñaah ɗu ɓaah ci : Woytohaat ɓi waaɗɗi yaaɓ, ɓaatɗohaat ɓi hot ne ɓa minɗi raak ini ɓa etoh, ɗu amboh ɓi raakɗi hatil, ɗu muñɗee ɓooɓi jen. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Wortukaat po ali ɓo' nga ɗu kinaat wirndoh miskiɗ in miskiɗ ; genaat ndengɗuk ŋ tum in baahiɗ ŋ harmban ɗu na ini kaɗ ŋ ɓooɓi jen.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Genaat ŋ sum. <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>Genaat ŋ kiim Kooh. <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Corkiɗaat Kooh ŋ in nu nik, in ceem ceɗ a waaɗ nga ɗu ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu. <verse eid="1TH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Kinaat hondoh <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> panguk. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Kinaat heef in ci Kooh na woye taamboh ŋ ɓo', <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>waaye markisaat in ci jen, ɗu amb ci baah nga. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Wortukaat in moɗaaɗi na findi wa min mand ɗah.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Kooh yi na onohe jam hoolɗaat ɗu wuu ce jameet ; a niiɗaat kiɓo' kiŋ ɗu jen, liiɓohaaci na ruuh ci na faan ci, ca nik raakaaɗi sikka ŋ hayiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Kooh yi na ɓeeɗkee ɗu cariɗ oolku, a hey tume ineem.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Ɓaah ci, kiimɗaat ɓoo Kooh. <verse eid="1TH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Kañɗaat ɓaah ci jen na morgiɗkoh huniɗ na keeñ hooliɗ. <verse eid="1TH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Mi yii nak ɗu ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi ne fiisi ɓoo kaɓɗoh ɗu wii, wa jangsaat ŋ fiki ɓaah ci jen ! <verse eid="1TH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa baahohaat ɗu !<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
